    "Levels of connected AirPods, Magic Mouse, Keyboard and Trackpad on the Tools page, and a short notice under the notch when one connects." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Levels of connected AirPods, Magic Mouse, Keyboard and Trackpad on the Tools page, and a short notice under the notch when one connects."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bağlı AirPods, Magic Mouse, Keyboard ve Trackpad'in pil düzeyleri Araçlar sayfasında; biri bağlandığında notch'un altında kısa bir bildirim."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AirPods levels need the Bluetooth permission below; Magic devices show theirs without it. Per-ear levels appear only for models that report them to macOS." : {
